      "content": "thanks but friends and doctors don't get it. it's just the same thing every time. i try so hard to stay clean and stay sane but the crash is always so much worse than before. it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. like why even bother fighting a battle i know i'm gonna lose anyway?",
